# Where the built app looks for the multiplayer server.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed vars at BUILD time, so this is baked into the
# bundle when you run `npm run build` / `npm run package` — a shipped desktop
# app can't be repointed later without a rebuild.
#
# Leave this unset for local development: the client falls back to
# ws://localhost:8787, which is what `npm run server` starts.
#
# For a real deployed server, copy this file to `.env` and set the deployed
# URL. Note wss:// (not ws://) once the host terminates TLS — every cloud
# platform below does, and a browser on an https page refuses a plain ws://
# connection.
#
# VITE_MP_SERVER_URL=wss://your-app-name.fly.dev
